                Schnittke and Stravinsky            </h3>

                            <p class="c-event-card__subtitle">Gianandrea Noseda and David Cohen</p>
            
            <p class="c-event-card__date">Sunday 16 May 2027 • 7pm</p>

            <p class="c-event-card__excerpt">LSO Principal Cello David Cohen takes centre stage for Schnittke's striking Cello Concerto No 1, ahead of a Stravinsky classic conducted by Gianandrea Noseda.</p>

                    </div>

